[url=http://oppai.me/6R4t][img]https://cdn-uploads.oppaiman.com/6846890_24-08-2024-12-54-48-016_thumb-SU-08-23.jpg[/img][/url]
Hello, Heroes!

We're gearing up for our big release on Steam, and our team is currently hard at work in Chapter 4! We'll release Forbbiden Fantasy on Steam as soon as Chapter 5 is done!

Today, I bring you the most amazing offerings: scorching hot preview animations from chapter 4! Zhara and Arlian look amazing in these, and I can’t wait to hear your thoughts about them. These are just a few of the animations you’ll see in Forbidden Fantasy! Are you ready?

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44763681/62e3558bb338a58a4d758b1b19ae0f6413a85fcc.gif[/img]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44763681/fc4a33688ac51d5dac51563faed7ce72f694d471.gif[/img]

Our animator is really shining in those, huh? We’re working very hard to make this chapter extra special for you! Here’s a quick summary of our progress in Chapter 4 so far:

[list]
[*] Storyboard: 7 scenes done, 2 in progress, 2 to go
[*] Blocking: 7 scenes done, 1 in progress, 3 to go;
[*] Lighting: 7 scenes done, 4 to go;
[*] Facial Expression: 7 scenes done, 4 to go;
[*] Cloth Simulation and Polish: 6 scenes done, 1 in progress, 4 to go;
[*] Animations: 16 in polishing stage, 22 to go;
[*] Characters and Script are done!;
[/list]

By the way, you already know you’ll have a hot time with Zhara and Arlian in this chapter, but, today, we’re glad to announce that you’ll have not only that, but a whole other sex scene, with a different character!

Can you guess who it is? Tell us who you want to be featured in it in the comments below!

See you soon,

f1r3
